{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014sVvsAUaPy8coUjmEo3m1g","type":"tool_result","content":"x anim: ok: 1 clip and 0 CMU takes match\nmesh2motion/Meditate  1.5s loop  sit rest idle — sits cross-legged, hands on the knees, breathing slowly\nreport: out/anim/find-meditate/report.json\nmesh2motion/Pushup  1.542s loop  emote exercise — push-ups: the body held straight, arms b\ncmu 88_02  55.5s acrobatics  fit 22/137 (inverted)  backflips, jump onto platform, handsta\nreport: out/anim/find-pushup/report.json\nmesh2motion/Cheer_One_arm  2.167s once  emote cheer — cheers with one fist raised high\nmesh2motion/Cheering_Two_Hands  1.583s once  emote cheer — cheers with both arms raised ov\nmesh2motion/Victory  1.667s once  emote cheer — jumps up with a fist raised in triumph and\nmesh2motion/Victory  1.667s once  emote cheer — jumps up with a fist raised in triumph and\nmesh2motion/Victory Fist Pump  2.25s once  emote cheer gesture — pumps a fist down at the \nreport: out/anim/find-victory/report.json\nmesh2motion/Greeting  4.833s once  emote gesture talk — lays the right hand on the chest a\nreport: out/anim/find-greeting/report.json\nquaternius/Jog_Fwd_Loop  0.933s loop speed 585  run — jog, in place\nreport: out/anim/find-jog-fwd/report.json\nquaternius/Sitting_Idle_Loop  1.667s loop  sit idle — seated at rest\nreport: out/anim/find-sitting-idle/report.json\ncmu/Wave_Hello  2.3s once  gesture — Waving hello with a raised hand\nreport: out/anim/find-wave-hello/report.json\ncmu/Stretch_Yawn  3.067s once  idle rest — A big stretch with a yawn, arms reaching up ove\ncmu 56_03  51.8s combat  fit 15/101  vignettes - fists up, wipe window, yawn, stretch, ang\ncmu 56_04  56.4s combat  fit 15/90  vignettes - fists up, wipe window, grab, lift open win\ncmu/Jumping_Jacks_Loop  1.133s loop  exercise — Jumping jacks: hop the feet apart while th\nmesh2motion/Jumping Jacks  1.25s loop  emote exercise — jumping jacks: the arms and legs s\ncmu 86_05  69.5s combat  fit 21/112  walking, jumping, jumping jacks, jumping on one foot,\nstyle100_idle/Balance_Idle  3.367s loop  idle style — Standing, balance style: arms out to\nquaternius/Idle_Shield_Break  1.067s once  shield hurt — the guard breaks: knocked back of\nreport: out/anim/find-balance-idle/report.json\nstyle100_idle/Lunge_Idle  2.5s loop  idle style — Standing, lunge style: wide step bend kn\nreport: out/anim/find-lunge-idle/report.json\nstyle100_back/Balance_WalkBack  1.867s loop speed 34  walk back style — Walking backward, \nstyle100/Balance_Walk  2.2s loop speed 36  walk style — Arms out to side for balance - til\nreport: out/anim/find-balance-walk/report.json\nquaternius/Dance_Loop  1s loop  emote dance — a one-second groove: hips sway, arms swing o\nreport: out/anim/find-dance-loop/report.json\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1011 Nov  5 02:43 data/anim/sets/mesh2motion/Meditate.json\n{\"clip\": \"Pushup\", \"src\": \"M2M_ANIMATED\", \"dur\": 1.542, \"loop\": true, \"tags\": [\"emote\",\"exercise\"], \"desc\": \"push-ups: the body held straight, arms bending and pressing up\", \"fps\": 24, \"via\": \"source\", \"contacts\": [{\"part\":\"footL\",\"from\":0,\"to\":1.533},{\"part\":\"footR\",\"from\":0,\"to\":1.533},{\"part\":\"handL\",\"from\":0,\"to\":1.533},{\"part\":\"handR\",\"from\":0,\"to\":1.533}], \"keys\": [\n  {\"t\":0,\n   \"hips\":[-7,0,49], \"body\":[0,75,0], \"chest\":[0,-12,0], \"head\":[0,17,0], \"spine\":[0,1,0],\n   \"shL\":[0,0], \"shR\":[0\n51:export interface ClipsSpec {\n52-  /** The clip sets it plays from, by id (`clipset:quaternius`): a bare clip name is the first set's. */\n53-  sets: readonly string[];\n54-  /** Contact IK and the lift when posed (true). */\n55-  ik?: boolean;\n56-  /** A blade held in the right hand, m, kept above the floor (0). */\n57-  blade?: number;\n58-  /** The clip it plays from the start (`SET/Clip`, or the clip and how it plays: the layer's `play`); none when absent. */\n59-  play?: string | ({ clip: string } & ClipPlay);\n60-}\n61-\n62-/** An entity with an animated actor and its clips. */\n63-type ClipActor = Pick<ActorComponents, 'actor' | 'animator'> & { id: number; clips: ClipsData };\n64-\n65-/** The layers of each world (see the file comment). */\n--\n93:export function clipsFor<C extends object>(world: World<C>, spec: ClipsSpec, build: Build | string): ClipsData {\n94-  const w = world as unknown as World;\n95-  const pool = poolOf(w);\n96-  const library = spec.sets.map((set) => pool.library(set));\n97-  if (!w.systems.has('actors.clips')) w.systems.add('actors.clips', stepClips, { phase: 'anim' });\n98-  const data = { sets: [...spec.sets], ik: spec.ik ?? true, blade: spec.blade ?? 0, state: emptyClipState() };\n99-  if (spec.play === undefined) return data;\n100-  const { clip, ...play } = typeof spec.play === 'string' ? { clip: spec.play } : spec.play;\n4: * `press('jump')` taps an action for the next step, `hold('sprint')` keeps one down, `axis('move', [0, 1])` pushes a\n5: * virtual stick (`[right, forward]`, turned by the camera as keys are), and `axis('cam' | 'look' | 'aim' | 'game:…',\n19: * pad.axis('move', [0, 1]);\n36:    fix: \"press(action) and hold(action) take an action's name; axis takes 'move' or 'look' [x, y], 'aim' [x, y, z], 'cam' (rad) or a 'ga\n37:    doc: 'Raised by the virtual device (engine/input/devices/virtual.ts) and `__engine.input` for an empty action name, an unknown axis, \n60:  /** Sets an axis: `move` `[right, forward]`, `look`, `aim`, `cam` or a `game:key`; `null` lets go. */\n61:  axis(name: string, value: unknown): void;\n95:    axis(name, value) {\n98:        throw codeError('INPUT_BAD_VIRTUAL', { what: `axis(${show(name)})`, problem: 'no such axis' });\n122:/** A checked copy of an axis value, or `INPUT_BAD_VIRTUAL`. */\n131:  throw codeError('INPUT_BAD_VIRTUAL', { what: `axis(${show(name)})`, problem: `${show(value)} is not ${want}` });\n134:/** One step's intents from a virtual sample: `move` turned by the heading `yaw` (the `cam` axis when it holds one). */","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d46f5b4-97b7-46a5-8fb8-5eac466a6eae","uuid":"c92396bb-f622-4bf9-87cd-d9e028edcccb","timestamp":"2026-11-05T09:49:10.915Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"x anim: ok: 1 clip and 0 CMU takes match\nmesh2motion/Meditate  1.5s loop  sit rest idle — sits cross-legged, hands on the knees, breathing slowly\nreport: out/anim/find-meditate/report.json\nmesh2motion/Pushup  1.542s loop  emote exercise — push-ups: the body held straight, arms b\ncmu 88_02  55.5s acrobatics  fit 22/137 (inverted)  backflips, jump onto platform, handsta\nreport: out/anim/find-pushup/report.json\nmesh2motion/Cheer_One_arm  2.167s once  emote cheer — cheers with one fist raised high\nmesh2motion/Cheering_Two_Hands  1.583s once  emote cheer — cheers with both arms raised ov\nmesh2motion/Victory  1.667s once  emote cheer — jumps up with a fist raised in triumph and\nmesh2motion/Victory  1.667s once  emote cheer — jumps up with a fist raised in triumph and\nmesh2motion/Victory Fist Pump  2.25s once  emote cheer gesture — pumps a fist down at the \nreport: out/anim/find-victory/report.json\nmesh2motion/Greeting  4.833s once  emote gesture talk — lays the right hand on the chest a\nreport: out/anim/find-greeting/report.json\nquaternius/Jog_Fwd_Loop  0.933s loop speed 585  run — jog, in place\nreport: out/anim/find-jog-fwd/report.json\nquaternius/Sitting_Idle_Loop  1.667s loop  sit idle — seated at rest\nreport: out/anim/find-sitting-idle/report.json\ncmu/Wave_Hello  2.3s once  gesture — Waving hello with a raised hand\nreport: out/anim/find-wave-hello/report.json\ncmu/Stretch_Yawn  3.067s once  idle rest — A big stretch with a yawn, arms reaching up ove\ncmu 56_03  51.8s combat  fit 15/101  vignettes - fists up, wipe window, yawn, stretch, ang\ncmu 56_04  56.4s combat  fit 15/90  vignettes - fists up, wipe window, grab, lift open win\ncmu/Jumping_Jacks_Loop  1.133s loop  exercise — Jumping jacks: hop the