{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkTsGhjd1okti5ndyrtc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This build is finished, and I'm not making more changes: the points the stop hook keeps raising can't be closed on this computer, and more work wouldn't change that.\n\n- **STAGE.md:** I've just re-read it above. It asks for three things:\n    - **Build the game PLAN.md describes:** built.\n    - **Take file names and hand-ins from TASK.md:** done, and all are in this folder.\n    - **Keep progress in `PROGRESS.md`:** kept up to date.\n- **Real hardware:** the DualSense's rumble, a TV and iOS Safari fall under TASK.md's section on what this computer doesn't have. Line 50 says: \"Test with the stand-ins; anything that needs the real thing is checked as far as it can be here, never required.\" The stand-ins are tested.\n- **Feel and sound:** TASK.md lists \"Nobody to listen\", and PLAN.md section 3 says nobody can play by hand here and that the delayed-thumb bot is how to judge feel. The bots meet every target and the sound is measured. Whether it's fun still needs a person, and I won't claim otherwise.\n- **The Line:** the retuned result is a checked outcome, not just a change. On 10 seeds, the scores are perfect 1000, human-like 814, sloppy 517 and idle 0, all within the plan's targets.\n- **`PLAN-CHECK.md`:** all 20 plan sections have a row, the files it cites exist, and the checks behind those rows ran in the final verify. The mapping itself is still my own reading of the plan, so it's worth skimming if you want to challenge a row.\n\n**Final state:** verify gave 213 passed, 0 failed on the delivered file (SHA-256 `129f65da…`). `npm test` passed on the same build (21 run, 17 skipped), and the engine is unchanged.\n\nIf the hook keeps repeating these same points, it's waiting on something only a person can do. Play the game, then clear the goal with `/goal clear`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":900,"cache_read_input_tokens":774934,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":900},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9d46f5b4-97b7-46a5-8fb8-5eac466a6eae","uuid":"a6c382e0-bca0-48b6-9784-9de8ba01e6a8","timestamp":"2026-11-05T21:07:53.440Z","request_id":"req_011CgkTsGDiiLHxmt4WtRSqr"}
